    "title": "Who from Bernalillo County area's former high school standouts will be active on Saturday, Dec. 13? - ABQ Times",
    "text": "These former Bernalillo County area high school standouts will be competing on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nAndrew Hill\nOklahoma Christian Eagles\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′3″\nSandia High School\nHometown: Albuquerque\nNext Game: vs. Midwestern State Mustangs, Saturday, Dec. 13, 3 p.m.\nDeniece Ryan\nFort Lewis Skyhawks\nGuard\nSenior\n5′2″\nHighland High School\nHometown: Albuquerque\nNext Game: vs. Adams State Grizzlies, Saturday, Dec. 13, 1 p.m.\nJaelyn Bates\nNew Mexico Highlands Cowgirls\nPoint guard\nJunior\n5′6″\nVolcano Vista High School\nHometown: Albuquerque\nNext Game: vs. Air Force Falcons, Saturday, Dec. 13, 1 p.m.\nJaxon Powell\nWheaton Thunder\nGraduate\n6′3″ 265\nManzano High School\nHometown: Yorktown\nNext Game: vs. UW River Falls Falcons, Saturday, Dec. 13, 2 p.m.\nJude Tapia\nFort Lewis Skyhawks\nGuard\nSenior\n5′11″ 175\nAlbuquerque High School\nHometown: Albuquerque\nNext Game: vs. Adams State Grizzlies, Saturday, Dec. 13, 12 a.m.\nThomas Adams\nAdams State Grizzlies\nGuard\nFreshman\n6′3″\nSandia High School\nHometown: Albuquerque\nNext Game: vs. Fort Lewis Skyhawks, Saturday, Dec. 13, 12 a.m.",
